[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2774436492","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104899#issuecomment-2774436492","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104899","id":2774436492,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6lXoqM","user":{"login":"NunoDasNeves","id":4468620,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0Njg2MjA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4468620?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NunoDasNeves","html_url":"https://github.com/NunoDasNeves","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NunoDasNeves/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NunoDasNeves/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NunoDasNeves/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NunoDasNeves/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NunoDasNeves/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NunoDasNeves/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NunoDasNeves/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NunoDasNeves/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NunoDasNeves/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-03T04:01:25Z","updated_at":"2025-04-03T04:01:40Z","body":"I saw this issue in my own project yesterday.\nIt only seems to repro when the Viewport is in fullscreen, without the \"Game\" toolbar visible at the top.\n\nI have this repro on my 1920x1080 monitor:\n1. Create a new project\n2. Set Project->Project Settings->Viewport Width/Height to 1920x1080\n3. Create a Node2D\n4. Create a Button child of the Node2D\n5. Run\n\nIt opens the game in full screen, with the \"Game\" toolbar hidden.\nThe button does not get hover state unless the mouse is a bit below and to the right of it.\n\n**I'm 99% sure the problem is the \"Game\" toolbar offset being added to the mouse cursor position when in fullscreen (when the toolbar is not present).**\n\nWorkarounds:\n- Go to Game-> three dot menu -> disable \"Embed Game on Next Play\" and it will run without the \"Game\" toolbar, but it won't be proper fullscreen (Windows taskbar will remain at bottom), or\n- Go to Game-> three dot menu -> disable \"Make Game Workspace Floating on Next Play\" to run it embedded in the editor, or\n- Set Project->Project Settings->Window Width/Height Override to 1919x1079 (any size smaller than the full resolution of your monitor)","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2774436492/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5460629983","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104899#issuecomment-5460629983","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104899","id":5460629983,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABRXqZ3w","user":{"login":"ashmys","id":103937907,"node_id":"U_kgDOBjH3cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/103937907?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashmys","html_url":"https://github.com/ashmys","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashmys/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashmys/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashmys/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashmys/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashmys/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashmys/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashmys/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashmys/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashmys/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-29T05:42:45Z","updated_at":"2026-08-29T05:42:45Z","body":"Confirmed still a bug in Godot 4.7.2.\n\nIf you turn on Embed Game on Next Play.\nAnd Window Mode is Fullscreen.\n\nYour Mouse or Touch is Offseted downward.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5460629983/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]